' Shared diagram style — one place to change line routing for every diagram.
'
'   polyline  straight segments with bends (default; stable with the smetana engine)
'   ortho     right angles; works, but on dense C4 diagrams labels collide with boxes
'   splines   curved (PlantUML default; what we moved away from)
'
' Spacing can be tuned here as well:
'   skinparam nodesep 25
'   skinparam ranksep 30

skinparam linetype polyline